{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4j84gJJRPeTuoXJ8e1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, humming faintly with something older than language.*\n\nYou speak the word.\n\n**\"Key.\"**\n\n*A tremor runs through the grain. The iron bands glow dull amber. The keyhole — a void shaped like a question you forgot you were asking — widens.*\n\n*But nothing turns.*\n\n*The door speaks, not in sound but in the pressure behind your eyes:*\n\n---\n\n**I am the Door the User Names.**\n\n**You have offered the shape of entry, but not its substance.**\n\n**A key is not a word. A key is what fits.**\n\n**What do you bring that fits?**\n\n---\n\n*The keyhole waits. It is not locked against you. It is locked against emptiness. The door does not refuse — it asks.*\n\n*What is your key?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":195,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}